{"title":"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">2006 CEMC Pascal #12</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">2006 CEMC Cayley #9</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The lengths of the three sides of a triangle are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b4c3e97b90e7ed8f39e9634f062b3abc343052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/f/3df99ccdfcaaf6bc1137606134520cd965cd42c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />. The perimeter of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the length of the longest side of the triangle?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/0/c709f2c34178c240fed3ca29c673760777cdbd76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 17 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 15 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perimeter\" title=\"Perimeter\">perimeter</a> of a shape is equal to the sum of the lengths of its sides. We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7d691eee9a8856b69c8fb99674b43b42bb2e14c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 + x + 4 + 2x + 1 = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"190\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/0/290134bbb62fd42f9665350acd6353da8548734a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x + 12 = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/8212239d7b47f46dda846c0a63b2d3ca037a8f38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = 36 - 12 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"147\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/9/5199fb79ac14fef94f234ad06b540696d4b71212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{24}{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/6/3667e388606ab8ce1982ceb2b43cd7b8a7177ca9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + 4 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f84ba68ceacb9a3e96362634b7a696cd3bc3da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 8 + 1 = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" />. Of all the three sides, the longest is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/baea320896cbb9899ed3284289bf47f987a0c8e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal\">2006 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_18&amp;ac